"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Kesar_the_Younger_d453cd.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Kesar the Younger.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Bounac\">Bounac</a>'s throne room, during day.<br/>In the quarters one floor down, during night.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The NPC version of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kesar\">Kesar</a>. He is a direct descendant of Kesar Etzel, the founder of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Order%20of%20the%20Lion\">Order of the Lion</a>. The siblings of his antecedent, <a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Master%20Oberon\">Oberon</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarlett%20Etzel\">Scarlett Etzel</a>, founded the <a href=\"#/wiki/Order%20of%20the%20Falcon\">Order of the Falcon</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Order%20of%20the%20Cobra\">Order of the Cobra</a>, respectively.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["adventures-of-galthen-quest","royal-bounacean-advisor-outfits-quest","the-order-of-the-lion-quest","the-order-of-the-stag-quest"],"pos":{"x":32365,"y":32478,"z":2}}